config DIAMANEOS_PRIVSW
	tristate "DiamaneOS privacy switch"
	depends on GPIOLIB && INPUT && OF
	help
	  Driver for a hardware slider that blocks the built-in sensors. It
	  reports the slider as an input switch and tells the sensor drivers
	  that register with it when to block their hardware. The policy is
	  written once at boot through /sys/kernel/privacy_switch/policy.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called diamaneos_privsw.

config DIAMANEOS_PRIVSW_KUNIT_TEST
	tristate "KUnit tests for the DiamaneOS privacy switch" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on KUNIT
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Tests the privacy switch's policy seal, fail-closed defaults and
	  debounce rules. They need no hardware.
